# Affiliate & compliance (hard rules)

1. Every Amazon URL MUST include `tag=thepickleb050-20`. Never emit one without it.
2. All affiliate links: `target="_blank"` and `rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"`.
3. Route every affiliate link through `AffiliateButton.astro`.
4. Do NOT display prices as current/authoritative. Use “Check current price on Amazon” CTAs; prefer price tiers ($/$$/$$$) or “as of” / approximate labeling — never a guaranteed live price.
5. FTC + Amazon disclosure on every page with affiliate links: top-of-body `Disclosure.astro` + footer.
6. Never fabricate prices, specs, weights, materials, ratings, or review counts. If missing, insert `{{ TODO: confirm }}` — do not guess.

```astro
<!-- ✅ -->
<AffiliateButton href={product.affiliateUrl} />

<!-- ❌ raw <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/..."> without tag / wrong rel -->
```

After builds with affiliate UI changes, run `npm run qa:affiliate`.
